    `aggregate of all amounts deducted as required from the remuneration of the employee for the year on account of the employee's contributions under this Act or under a provincial pension plan` IS 5_000
#ASSERT `s 8(2) — the excess amount calculated` `facts 2: 5,000 deducted` EQUALS JUST 944.5
#ASSERT `s 8(2) — an excess amount has been paid` `facts 2: 5,000 deducted` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(3) — the overpayment made by the employee on account of the employee's contributions under this Act` `facts 2: 5,000 deducted` EQUALS JUST 944.5

