#ASSERT `s 8(2) — the excess amount calculated` `facts 2b: one cent too much` EQUALS JUST 0.01

-- Case 3: two employers under this Act paying 50,000 each (100,000 in all). Each deducted (4.95%) of (50,000 - 3,500), (1%) of 46,500 and nothing on the second tier;
-- together 2 x 2,301.75 + 2 x 465 = 5,533.50. Due: 3,217.50 + 650 + 188 = 4,055.50, so the excess is 1,478.
