    `the contribution rate for employees for the year under this Act` IS (4.95%)
    `the first additional contribution rate for employees for the year under this Act` IS (1%)
    `the second additional contribution rate for employees for the year under this Act` IS (4%)
    `the base contribution rate for employees for the year under a provincial pension plan` IS (5.4%)
    `the first additional contribution rate for employees for the year under a provincial pension plan` IS (1%)
    `the second additional contribution rate for employees for the year under a provincial pension plan` IS (4%)
    `the employee's basic exemption for the year` IS 3_500
    `the employee's basic exemption for the year, determined without taking into account paragraphs 19(b) and (c)` IS 3_500
    `the employee's maximum contributory earnings for the year` IS 65_000
    `the employee's maximum contributory earnings for the year, determined without taking into account paragraphs 17(b) and (c) and 19(b) and (c)` IS 65_000
    `the employee's maximum pensionable earnings for the year` IS 68_500
    `the employee's maximum pensionable earnings for the year, determined without taking into account paragraphs 17(b) and (c)` IS 68_500
    `the employee's additional maximum pensionable earnings for the year` IS 73_200
    `the employee's additional maximum pensionable earnings for the year, determined without taking into account paragraphs 17.1(b) and (c)` IS 73_200
    `aggregate of all amounts deducted as required from the remuneration of the employee for the year on account of the employee's contributions under this Act` IS 5_533.5
    `aggregate of all amounts deducted as required from the remuneration of the employee for the year on account of the employee's contributions under this Act or under a provincial pension plan` IS 5_533.5
#ASSERT `s 8(4) — the ratio of the salary and wages under this Act to the aggregate, before 2024 limited by the maximum pensionable earnings and from 2024 by the additional maximum pensionable earnings` `facts 3: two employers` EQUALS JUST 1
#ASSERT `s 8(2) — the excess amount calculated` `facts 3: two employers` EQUALS JUST 1_478
#ASSERT `s 8(3) — the overpayment made by the employee on account of the employee's contributions under this Act` `facts 3: two employers` EQUALS JUST 1_478

-- Case 4: half under this Act (30,000) and half under a provincial pension plan (30,000), 2024. Ratio 1/2 under (4) and (8).
-- (4) 1,750; (5) 32,500; (6) 1,750; (7) 32,500; (8) 36,600; (9) 34,250; (10) 36,600; (11) 34,250.
-- (a) 0.0495 x 28,250 = 1,398.375; (a.1) 0.01 x 28,250 = 282.5; (a.2) 0; (b) 0.054 x 28,250 = 1,525.5; (c) 282.5; (d) 0. Sum 3,488.875.
`facts 4: half provincial` MEANS `cp1 Facts about the contributions of an employee for a year` WITH
    `the year at hand` IS 2024
    `employments of the employee in the year` IS LIST `CPP 30,000`, `provincial 30,000`
    `contributory self-employed earnings of the employee for the year, if the employee is an individual described in section 10 to whom the provisions relating to the making of contributions apply` IS NOTHING
    `the contribution rate for employees for the year under this Act` IS (4.95%)
    `the first additional contribution rate for employees for the year under this Act` IS (1%)
    `the second additional contribution rate for employees for the year under this Act` IS (4%)
    `the base contribution rate for employees for the year under a provincial pension plan` IS (5.4%)
    `the first additional contribution rate for employees for the year under a provincial pension plan` IS (1%)
    `the second additional contribution rate for employees for the year under a provincial pension plan` IS (4%)
    `the employee's basic exemption for the year` IS 3_500
    `the employee's basic exemption for the year, determined without taking into account paragraphs 19(b) and (c)` IS 3_500
    `the employee's maximum contributory earnings for the year` IS 65_000
    `the employee's maximum contributory earnings for the year, determined without taking into account paragraphs 17(b) and (c) and 19(b) and (c)` IS 65_000
    `the employee's maximum pensionable earnings for the year` IS 68_500
    `the employee's maximum pensionable earnings for the year, determined without taking into account paragraphs 17(b) and (c)` IS 68_500
    `the employee's additional maximum pensionable earnings for the year` IS 73_200
    `the employee's additional maximum pensionable earnings for the year, determined without taking into account paragraphs 17.1(b) and (c)` IS 73_200
    `aggregate of all amounts deducted as required from the remuneration of the employee for the year on account of the employee's contributions under this Act` IS 1_700
    `aggregate of all amounts deducted as required from the remuneration of the employee for the year on account of the employee's contributions under this Act or under a provincial pension plan` IS 3_500
#ASSERT `s 8(4) — the ratio of the salary and wages under this Act to the aggregate, before 2024 limited by the maximum pensionable earnings and from 2024 by the additional maximum pensionable earnings` `facts 4: half provincial` EQUALS JUST (1 DIVIDED BY 2)
#ASSERT `s 8(8) — the ratio of the salary and wages under this Act to the aggregate, each employment limited by the additional maximum pensionable earnings` `facts 4: half provincial` EQUALS JUST (1 DIVIDED BY 2)
#ASSERT `s 8(2) — the excess amount calculated` `facts 4: half provincial` EQUALS JUST 11.125
#ASSERT `s 8(2) — an excess amount has been paid` `facts 4: half provincial` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (a) of 8(3): 1,700 - (1,398.375 + 282.5 + 0) = 19.125 ; (b) the excess 11.125 ; the lesser is 11.125.
#ASSERT `s 8(3) — the overpayment made by the employee on account of the employee's contributions under this Act` `facts 4: half provincial` EQUALS JUST 11.125

