§ `Tests -- section 8(4) to (11): the prorated portions`
-- 8(4): exemption x ratio. 8(5): maximum contributory earnings x ratio. 8(6), 8(7), 8(10), 8(11): the difference.
#ASSERT `s 8(4) — the prorated portion of the employee's basic exemption` 3_500 (1 DIVIDED BY 2) EQUALS 1_750
#ASSERT `s 8(5) — the prorated portion of the employee's maximum contributory earnings` 65_000 (1 DIVIDED BY 2) EQUALS 32_500
#ASSERT `s 8(6) — the prorated portion of the employee's basic exemption for a provincial pension plan` 2_000 1_750 EQUALS 250
#ASSERT `s 8(7) — the prorated portion of the employee's maximum contributory earnings for a provincial pension plan` 65_000 32_500 EQUALS 32_500
#ASSERT `s 8(8) — the prorated portion of the employee's additional maximum pensionable earnings` 73_200 (1 DIVIDED BY 2) EQUALS 36_600
#ASSERT `s 8(9) — the prorated portion of the employee's maximum pensionable earnings` 68_500 (1 DIVIDED BY 2) EQUALS 34_250
#ASSERT `s 8(10) — the prorated portion of the employee's additional maximum pensionable earnings for a provincial pension plan` 73_200 36_600 EQUALS 36_600
#ASSERT `s 8(11) — the prorated portion of the employee's maximum pensionable earnings for a provincial pension plan` 68_500 34_250 EQUALS 34_250
#ASSERT `s 8(4) — the prorated portion of the employee's basic exemption` 3_500 1 EQUALS 3_500

